---
import { ArrowLeftRight, ArrowRight, Cpu, Target, Workflow } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<figure class="local-ai-diagram not-content">
  <div class="local-ai-flow">
    <div class="local-ai-node">
      <Target size={20} aria-hidden="true" />
      <strong>Team goal</strong>
      <span>Invokes a playbook</span>
    </div>
    <div class="local-ai-edge"><ArrowRight size={20} aria-hidden="true" /></div>
    <div class="local-ai-node local-ai-harness">
      <Workflow size={20} aria-hidden="true" />
      <strong>Agent harness</strong>
      <span>Resolves the workspace’s model binding, checks outputs, and governs tools</span>
    </div>
    <div class="local-ai-edge">
      <span>Request and response</span>
      <ArrowLeftRight size={20} aria-hidden="true" />
    </div>
    <div class="local-ai-node">
      <Cpu size={20} aria-hidden="true" />
      <strong>Local inference server</strong>
      <span>Ollama on Mac mini<br />vLLM on DGX Spark</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>The model server returns a response or proposes a tool call. The harness checks permissions and approvals before dispatching any tool.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .local-ai-diagram {
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
    padding: clamp(0.875rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--ap-line);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }

  .local-ai-flow { display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; }

  .local-ai-node {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    min-width: 0;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--ap-line);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    background: var(--ap-surface);
  }

  .local-ai-harness { border-color: var(--ap-muted); }

  .local-ai-node svg,
  .local-ai-node > span,
  .local-ai-edge,
  figcaption { color: var(--ap-muted); }

  .local-ai-node > span,
  figcaption { font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.45; }

  .local-ai-edge {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .local-ai-edge svg { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  figcaption { margin-top: 0.9rem; }

  @media (min-width: 60rem) {
    .local-ai-flow { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1.35fr minmax(4.5rem, 0.45fr) 1.2fr; }
    .local-ai-edge svg { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
